{"tuid":"6gtq9ahrolz2ry2","pageVersion":18,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2024-12-28"},"identification":{"ifids":["ZCODE-2-201128-6B98","ZCODE-4-220107-DE48"],"format":"zcode"},"bibliographic":{"title":"Tristam Island","author":"Hugo Labrande","language":"en","firstpublished":"2020-11-20","genre":"Mystery","description":"After crashing your plane at sea, you end up drifting to a small island, with not much to survive. You explore, and find out the island was inhabited, years ago. But why did the people leave? And why is there a fence around the white house at the top of the hill? <br> <br>TRISTAM ISLAND is a text adventure made from the mold of Infocom; expect a large geography to explore, lots of prose, a rich parser, diverse puzzles, some humor and some darkness. To use Infocom&#039;s classification, I&#039;d rate the game&#039;s difficulty as &quot;Standard&quot;; however, the game&#039;s design is modern and eschews all the frustrations commonly associated with 1980s text adventures. No hunger timers, no frustrating mazes, no blocking situations that force you to restart!"},"contacts":{"url":"http://hlabrande.itch.io/tristam-island"},"ifdb":{"tuid":"6gtq9ahrolz2ry2","pageversion":18,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=6gtq9ahrolz2ry2","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=6gtq9ahrolz2ry2&version=18"},"playTimeInMinutes":360,"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Funbox.ifarchive.org%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fifarchive.org%252Fif-archive%252Fgames%252Fzcode%252Ftristam-island.zip%26open%3Dtristam-en.z3","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://hlabrande.itch.io/tristam-island","title":"Full game on itch.io","format":"html"},{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/zcode/tristam-island.zip","playOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Funbox.ifarchive.org%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fifarchive.org%252Fif-archive